#sortorder:2
#showas:尖塔 A - 注入之友崛起
A more specialist scenario. Mainly you and two AIs, and it's set to difficulty 7.

This is on the Bubbles map type, with 80+ planets. Full Ensemble AI type in both cases.
Your starting fleet is set to "Classic," which has the most basic available options.

The main component of this one is Infused Spire, a player type which is a somewhat simpler way to play as Spire and will serve as an introduction to its playstyle.  Spire gameplay focuses heavily on much larger battles, with numerous super units, and another way to win the game.

This can play very differently from normal, and is not recommended for new players.  